{"seq":1,"slug":"incoming-inspection-defect-classification","title":"来料检验(IQC/AQL)与缺陷分级判定模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/quality-incident-detection-triage/incoming-inspection-defect-classification","wordCount":3041,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"来料检验-iqc-aql-与缺陷分级判定模型\">来料检验(IQC/AQL)与缺陷分级判定模型</h1><p>一批从东莞发往美国海外仓的 15 万条 Type-C 数据线，供应商随货附了一份「全数合格」的 CoA；IQC 台位按 ISO 2859-1 抽了 200 条，判出 3 条不通电、2 条外壳毛刺，判定「不合格、退货」。供应商立刻抗议：3/200 只是 1.5%，而合同写的 AQL 是 2.5%，凭什么退？这个争执的答案不在「1.5% 比 2.5% 小」这条算术里，而在抽样的接收准则、缺陷分级与「一个检验批的判定代表什么」这三件被混为一谈的事上。来料检验（Incoming Quality Control, IQC）与缺陷分级判定模型要解决的，就是把「收到一批货，怎么抽、怎么判、判完代表什么」变成一套可复现、可审计、可被供应商挑战的程序，而不是检验员的个人判断。IQC 是整条质量事件链路的第一道闸门：它判出的每一个不合格，都是下一章 <a href=\"../scar-8d-root-cause/\">8D 与根因分析</a> 的输入，也是驱动供应商纠正措施要求（SCAR）的触发源之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-检验批-抽样方案与缺陷分级\">核心概念：检验批、抽样方案与缺陷分级</h2><p>三个词在本章有严格定义，后面所有规则都建立在它们上。</p>\n<p><strong>检验批（inspection lot）</strong> 是一组在相同条件下生产、可被当作一个整体接收或拒收的产品单元，通常是「同物料 + 同供应商 + 同生产日期/工单 + 同工艺参数」的最大集合。批的划分不是行政便利，而是统计前提：把两个不同电芯批次的移动电源合并成一个检验批，会让内部变异污染抽样结论。跨境场景下，一个检验批往往对应一张 ASN（EDI 856）里的一个装运单元或一个 SSCC 下的若干箱。</p>\n<p><strong>抽样方案（sampling plan）</strong> 是一组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n, Ac, Re)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 参数：样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、接收数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、拒收数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>。它规定了「抽多少、允许多少个不合格仍接收」。抽样方案不是目的，而是把「允许多大比例的缺陷流入」这一商业决定，翻译成可执行的检验动作。</p>\n<p><strong>缺陷分级（defect classification）</strong> 是把每一条检出的不合格，按其后果严重程度归入等级（典型为 Critical / Major / Minor），每个等级绑定各自的 AQL。分级的依据不是「看起来严不严重」，而是缺陷一旦流出后的后果类别：是否危及人身安全、是否违反法规、是否导致功能失效、是否仅影响外观。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检验批</td>\n<td>同条件、可整体判定</td>\n<td>跨批合并抽样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抽样方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n,Ac,Re)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>由检验水平 + AQL 查出</td>\n<td>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 当成「允许缺陷率」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺陷分级</td>\n<td>绑定后果类别与各自 AQL</td>\n<td>按主观印象定级，无字典</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定结论</td>\n<td>只对该批当次有效</td>\n<td>当成对供应商整体能力的结论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"抽样方案-从-aql-到-oc-曲线\">抽样方案：从 AQL 到 OC 曲线</h2><p>主流做法依据 ISO 2859-1（中国等同采用为 GB/T 2828.1）的计数型抽样体系。它的使用路径是：先按批量（lot size）查样本量字码（sample size code letter，A–R），再按检验水平（一般水平 I/II/III，默认 II）与选定的 AQL 查表得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac/Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>。检验严格度分正常（normal）、加严（tightened）、放宽（reduced）三档，并有一条开关规则：连续 5 批中有 2 批不合格则转加严，加严下连续 5 批合格才回正常——这条规则把「单批判定」串成了对供应商状态的跟踪。</p>\n<p>抽样方案的统计本质是一条接收概率曲线（Operating Characteristic curve, OC 曲线）。对计数型单次抽样，接收概率为二项分布：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) = \\sum_{d=0}^{Ac} \\binom{n}{d} p^d (1-p)^{n-d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>曲线上的两个关键点定义了两类风险：<strong>生产方风险点</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0.95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{0.95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（AQL 处，合格批被误拒概率约 5%）与<strong>使用方风险点</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0.10</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{0.10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即批质量坏到 LTPD（Lot Tolerance Percent Defective，极限质量）时仍有 10% 概率被接收。跨境采购里真正该写进合同的数是 LTPD——它回答「我最坏会放进什么样的批」。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>一个常被忽略的事实：ISO 2859-1 只保证「质量恰为 AQL 的批，被接收概率约 95%」，它<strong>不保证</strong>被接收批的缺陷率不超过 AQL。若批的真实缺陷率高于 AQL，方案仍会放过一部分这样的批。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>针对安全件与高可靠性品类，业界普遍改用 <strong>C=0 零接收数抽样方案</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，任何一条不合格即拒收）。它的逻辑是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 等于「 knowingly 允许若干不合格品流入」，这对消费电子安全件（电池、充电器、儿童用品）不可接受。C=0 用更小的样本量达到与传统 AQL 方案相当的 LTPD 保护，代价是生产方风险更高，故要求供应商过程能力足够强才公平。自营品控中 C=0 常与「跳批检验（skip-lot）」组合：连续 N 批合格且能提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 证据则降低检验频次，一旦不合格立即恢复全检并转加严。</p>\n<p>抽样方法本身也是变量：属性抽样（计数合格/不合格）成本低、信息量少；变量抽样（测量尺寸、电阻等连续量）在同样样本量下判别力更强，但要求测量系统可靠。测量系统的可信度由 MSA（AIAG《测量系统分析》第四版）界定：%GRR &lt; 10% 方可用于判定，10%–30% 需结合风险，&gt;30% 不可接受。用 %GRR 达 40% 的卡尺判 0.05 mm 级外观缺陷，等于在噪声上做统计判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缺陷分级判定模型-critical-major-minor\">缺陷分级判定模型：Critical / Major / Minor</h2><p>分级的核心是先把「后果」定义清楚，再让 AQL 与处置动作跟着后果走。三级划分在跨境制造业中最通用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>后果定义</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n<th>常见 AQL 档</th>\n<th>批判定与处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Critical（致命）</td>\n<td>危及人身安全、违反强制法规、造成不可逆损害</td>\n<td>电池热失控、绝缘耐压击穿、儿童用品小零件可脱落、RoHS 超标</td>\n<td>0（C=0）或 0.065</td>\n<td>一票否决，整批拒收 + 强制 SCAR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Major（主要）</td>\n<td>功能失效或严重降低可用性，客户会退货</td>\n<td>不通电、容量虚标 &gt;10%、接口插拔失效、软件不识别</td>\n<td>0.65 / 1.0 / 1.5</td>\n<td>按方案判定；重缺陷常叠加 MRB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Minor（次要）</td>\n<td>仅影响外观或轻微体验，不影响功能</td>\n<td>外壳毛刺、丝印偏移、包装皱损</td>\n<td>2.5 / 4.0</td>\n<td>按方案判定，可让步接收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套分级的锚点必须来自产品本身的风险分析，而非检验员经验。通行做法是把 FMEA（AIAG &amp; VDA《FMEA 手册》2019 版）的严重度（Severity, S）1–10 刻度映射到三级：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\ge 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 归 Critical，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5 \\le S \\le 8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 归 Major，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S \\le 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 归 Minor。2019 版 FMEA 手册用**行动优先级（Action Priority, AP）**取代了旧的 RPN 相乘，正是因为「高严重度 × 低频度」的相乘会稀释安全风险——同理，分级模型里 Critical 的 AQL 也不应因「很少发生」而放松。</p>\n<p>分级落到系统里，必须有一本<strong>缺陷代码字典（defect code dictionary）</strong>：每个缺陷模式一个稳定 code，绑定等级、检测方法、判定基准（含公差与图示）、责任工序。字典让「不通电」在 IQC 台位、供应商复检、第三方检验（SGS、Bureau Veritas、Intertek、QIMA 等）三处得到同一个 code 与判定，否则跨系统缺陷统计无法聚合，供应商绩效也失去可比性。</p>\n<p>判定结果不只有「合格/不合格」两值。完整的处置（disposition）集合包括：接收（accept）、拒收退货（reject &amp; return）、挑选/全检（100% inspection）、返工（rework）、让步接收（use-as-is，须由工程与质量联合签署并记录理由）、降级使用（downgrade）。让步接收风险最高，它把「已知的不合格」放进了供应链，必须单独留痕并计入该批 DPPM 与供应商绩效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定证据链与误读修正\">判定证据链与误读修正</h2><p>IQC 记录的价值不在结论，而在证据链。一条可用于后续 8D 与供应商对账的检验记录，至少应包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主体与批次键</strong>：物料与供应商主数据 ID、检验批键（lot/ASN/SSCC）；</li>\n<li><strong>方案快照</strong>：检验水平、AQL、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、严格度——缺了它，这批结论事后无法复现；</li>\n<li><strong>缺陷明细</strong>：缺陷 code 与等级、测量值与判定基准——缺了 code，跨批次统计无从聚合；</li>\n<li><strong>责任与放行</strong>：检验员与时间戳、处置结论与放行签署。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对抽检结论的两种典型误读必须工程化修正。其一是<strong>把「合格」当成「零缺陷」</strong>：抽检合格只意味着该批通过了本方案的门槛。当客户要求的是低 DPPM 供货时，应把验收方式从「AQL 抽检」升级为「过程能力验收」——要求供应商提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 DPPM 证据。缺陷率与西格玛水平的换算是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DPPM</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>缺陷数</mtext><mtext>检验单元数</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mtext>DPPM</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DPPM} = \\frac{\\text{缺陷数}}{\\text{检验单元数}} \\times 10^{6}, \\qquad Z = \\Phi^{-1}\\!\\left(1 - \\frac{\\text{DPPM}}{10^{6}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPPM</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检验单元数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缺陷数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DPPM</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>业界常用的「六西格玛」对应 3.4 DPPM，是计入 1.5σ 长期漂移后的口径；不做该修正时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z=6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 的理论值约为 0.002 DPPM。跨部门沟通时必须声明用的是哪个口径。其二是<strong>把「抽检不合格」等同于「供应商整体不合格」</strong>：单批判定与该供应商的能力是两件事，能力评估属于供应商绩效范畴，不应由一次 IQC 结论下判。</p>\n<p>对连续量判定，可用<strong>变量数据</strong>做更强推断：由样本均值与标准差估计批不良率，信息量大于属性抽样的计数。但它要求分布近似正态且测量系统可靠，对破坏性检验的来料往往不可行，此时仍回到属性抽样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判决流程与多源联动\">判决流程与多源联动</h2><p>把抽样、分级、判定与后续动作串成一条可执行流程，关键是让「统计判定」与「工程判定」在各自边界内完成，不互相越权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[来料批到货&lt;br/&gt;建检验批键 lot/ASN/SSCC] --&gt; B[选定检验水平与各等级AQL&lt;br/&gt;Critical/Major/Minor]&#10;    B --&gt; C[按 ISO 2859-1 查 n / Ac / Re&lt;br/&gt;确定严格度]&#10;    C --&gt; D[按缺陷代码字典逐项检验&lt;br/&gt;记录测量值与 code]&#10;    D --&gt; E{各级不合格数&lt;br/&gt;是否超 Ac}&#10;    E --&gt;|均未超| F[判定合格&lt;br/&gt;放行入库&lt;br/&gt;更新绩效]&#10;    E --&gt;|Critical 出现 或&lt;br/&gt;Major/Minor 超 Ac| G[判定不合格&lt;br/&gt;整批扣留]&#10;    G --&gt; H[MRB 处置评审&lt;br/&gt;退货/全检/返工/让步]&#10;    H --&gt; I{是否批次性&lt;br/&gt;或 Critical}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[触发 SCAR&lt;br/&gt;进入 8D&lt;br/&gt;转多源分诊]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[记录缺陷&lt;br/&gt;计入趋势看板]\">flowchart TD\n    A[来料批到货&lt;br/&gt;建检验批键 lot/ASN/SSCC] --&gt; B[选定检验水平与各等级AQL&lt;br/&gt;Critical/Major/Minor]\n    B --&gt; C[按 ISO 2859-1 查 n / Ac / Re&lt;br/&gt;确定严格度]\n    C --&gt; D[按缺陷代码字典逐项检验&lt;br/&gt;记录测量值与 code]\n    D --&gt; E{各级不合格数&lt;br/&gt;是否超 Ac}\n    E --&gt;|均未超| F[判定合格&lt;br/&gt;放行入库&lt;br/&gt;更新绩效]\n    E --&gt;|Critical 出现 或&lt;br/&gt;Major/Minor 超 Ac| G[判定不合格&lt;br/&gt;整批扣留]\n    G --&gt; H[MRB 处置评审&lt;br/&gt;退货/全检/返工/让步]\n    H --&gt; I{是否批次性&lt;br/&gt;或 Critical}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[触发 SCAR&lt;br/&gt;进入 8D&lt;br/&gt;转多源分诊]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[记录缺陷&lt;br/&gt;计入趋势看板]</pre><p>流程中有两处必须与上下游系统联动。向上，抽样方案快照与缺陷 code 必须写进批次记录，供 <a href=\"multi-source-signal-severity-triage\">多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊</a> 把它当作一条带批次键与缺陷模式的信号消费；向下，任何判定为 Critical 或批次性的不合格，直接触发 SCAR，而非等售后信号累积。这一条与 ISO 9001 的 8.7 不合格输出控制、以及 IATF 16949:2016 的 8.5.6.1 变更控制要求一致：持续的不合格与未申报的变更，都必须在来料端被捕获，而不是流到客户端才被发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>来料检验的判定不是「合格率算术」，而是三件事的组合：抽样方案定义了「我能看见多大的缺陷率」及其两类风险（AQL 处的 5% 生产方风险、LTPD 处的 10% 使用方风险）；缺陷分级把后果类别翻译成各自绑定的 AQL，并以 FMEA 严重度为锚点、以缺陷代码字典为保证一致性的载体；判定结论只对该检验批当次有效，把它上升为对供应商能力的结论是越权。安全件与高可靠性品类应用 C=0 方案替代 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的传统方案，并以跳批检验与过程能力验收（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{pk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、DPPM）补足抽样本身的盲区。每一批 IQC 的结论都应带着可复现的证据链（抽样快照 + 缺陷 code + 处置签署）进入下一环：批次性不合格触发 SCAR 并进入 8D 根因分析，全部结论则作为一条带批次键的信号汇入多源分诊模型，与其他来源信号对齐后共同决定事件严重度。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"来料检验(IQC/AQL)与缺陷分级判定模型","id":"来料检验-iqc-aql-与缺陷分级判定模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：检验批、抽样方案与缺陷分级","id":"核心概念-检验批-抽样方案与缺陷分级"},{"level":2,"text":"抽样方案：从 AQL 到 OC 曲线","id":"抽样方案-从-aql-到-oc-曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"缺陷分级判定模型：Critical / Major / Minor","id":"缺陷分级判定模型-critical-major-minor"},{"level":2,"text":"判定证据链与误读修正","id":"判定证据链与误读修正"},{"level":2,"text":"判决流程与多源联动","id":"判决流程与多源联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"多源质量信号聚合与严重度分诊规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-quality-incident-scar-8d-closed-loop/quality-incident-detection-triage/multi-source-signal-severity-triage"}}